WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

00:00.000 --> 00:01.580
Every business. A macro close-up of an eye.

00:01.580 --> 00:03.000
Something worth protecting. A gloved hand on the steering wheel in a dark cab, the dashboard glowing.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
Ignition. A truck’s wheel and chrome steps on a wet road as the air brakes release.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.080
Vehicles. Fuel. A DigitFMS truck pulls away on a wet road at dawn.

00:07.080 --> 00:09.540
People. Property. The view from the cab: the highway ahead and the navigation screen.

00:09.540 --> 00:12.620
Route deviation detected. Tail lights on a dusk highway; a red line and label flag a route deviation.

00:12.620 --> 00:15.000
Knowing what is happening. The truck rounds a bend while labels track its location, speed, fuel and driver events.

00:15.000 --> 00:16.710
24/7 control room. An operator on a headset follows a red route across a wall of maps.

00:16.710 --> 00:18.380
Fleet. A depot at night; a red line leads across the wet yard to a truck.

00:18.380 --> 00:19.580
Sites. Access. A security camera on a warehouse wall watches the perimeter.

00:19.580 --> 00:21.040
Fuel intelligence. A fuel display with a red label: Fuel drop verified.

00:21.040 --> 00:22.750
AI CCTV. Access control. At the gate, a red box recognises the truck’s number plate and the barrier lifts.

00:22.750 --> 00:24.960
Mobile video. Live fleet map. A gloved hand holds a phone showing the truck’s live route.

00:24.960 --> 00:27.790
See more. Control more. The truck crosses a bridge towards a city skyline at sunrise.

00:27.790 --> 00:30.050
End card. The DigitFMS logo on black: Book your free security assessment. Protect what keeps your business moving.
